# PQ-001: Track iron–thiocyanate complex formation with a ligand pulse
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 HCl 0.001mol
add v1 FeCl3 0.0001mol
measure v1 uvvis
add v1 KSCN 0.0001mol
measure v1 uvvis
inspect v1
add v1 KSCN 0.0009mol
measure v1 uvvis
inspect
